   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pharmacy instructions",
     "texto": [
      "At the pharmacy («de apotheek»), to ask for something against a pain one says «Heeft u iets tegen keelpijn?» (Do you have something for a sore throat?). The separable verb «innemen» means to take or swallow a medicine: «Hoe vaak moet ik ze innemen?» (How often must I take them?). The separable particle «in» goes at the end of the affirmative sentence: «Neem ze met water in»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
